    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 t-es">
      Ofrecemos servicios profesionales de mejora y limpieza de propiedades.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">

      <!-- Roofing -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:border-indigo hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] transition">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-indigo">🏠</div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-en">Roofing</h3>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-es">Techos</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-en">Roof installation, repairs & replacement.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-es">Instalación, reparación y reemplazo de techos.</p>
        <a href="/services/roofing" class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo text-white rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigo/90 transition">
          <span class="t-en">Learn More</span>
          <span class="t-es">Más Info</span> →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Pressure Washing -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:border-indigo hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] transition">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-indigo">💧</div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-en">Pressure Washing</h3>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-es">Limpieza a Presión</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-en">Deep cleaning for homes, driveways & siding.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-es">Limpieza profunda para casas, entradas y exteriores.</p>
        <a href="/services/pressure-washing" class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo text-white rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigo/90 transition">
          <span class="t-en">Learn More</span>
          <span class="t-es">Más Info</span> →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Remodeling -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:border-indigo hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] transition">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-indigo">🛠️</div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-en">Remodeling</h3>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-es">Remodelación</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-en">Kitchen, bath, and full home remodeling.</p>
        <p  class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-es">Cocinas, baños y remodelación completa del hogar.</p>
        <a href="/services/remodeling" class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo text-white rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigo/90 transition">
          <span class="t-en">Learn More</span>
          <span class="t-es">Más Info</span> →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Painting -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:border-indigo hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.15)] transition">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-indigo">🎨</div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-en">Painting</h3>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 t-es">Pintura</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-en">Interior & exterior professional painting.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 t-es">Pintura interior y exterior profesional.</p>
        <a href="/services/painting" class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo text-white rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigo/90 transition">
          <span class="t-en">Learn More</span>
          <span class="t-es">Más Info</span> →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- CTA + FORM -->
<section id="quote" class="pt-20 pb-0 bg-indigo text-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center animate-fadeIn pb-0 mb-0">

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 t-en">
      Ready To Get Started?
    </h2>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 t-es">
      ¿Listo Para Comenzar?
    </h2>

    <p class="text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 t-en">
      Call us or request a free estimate using the form below.
    </p>
    <p class="text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 t-es">
      Llámanos o solicita una cotización gratis usando el formulario.
    </p>

    <!-- Call Button -->
    <a 
      href="tel:+16149840351"
      class="inline-block mb-10 px-10 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-indigo font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition"
    >
      📞 Call Now
    </a>

    <!-- Contact Form -->
    <form class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 bg-white text-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg md:col-span-2">

      <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required class="p-3 rounded border border-gray-300 w-full" />
      <input type="tel" placeholder="Phone Number" required class="p-3 rounded border border-gray-300 w-full" />

      <input type="text" placeholder="City / Area" required class="p-3 rounded border border-gray-300 w-full md:col-span-2" />

      <textarea placeholder="Tell us about your project..." rows="4" required class="p-3 rounded border border-gray-300 w-full md:col-span-2"></textarea>

      <button class="md:col-span-2 bg-indigo text-white py-3 rounded font-semibold hover:bg-indigo/90 transition">
        Send Request
      </button>
    </form>

  </div>

  <!-- COPYRIGHT + BUSINESS INFO -->
  <div class="text-center text-white/70 text-sm mt-10 space-y-1 pb-3 mb-0">
    <div>
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} Ozuna Construction LLC. All Rights Reserved.
    </div>
    <div class="text-white/60 text-xs">
      Licensed & Insured • Serving Columbus, OH and Surrounding Areas
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
